        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Family attribution \u0026 static/dynamic analysis: Lold/1.0 (LOLD_CFG_V1) native x64 chunked downloader/loader (hermesik.exe = 'little Hermes') for the Hermes MaaS stealer/RAT platform (Malpedia win.hermes_stealer; ref: https://papers.lisdex.sh/hermes/report.pdf), staged at http://107.175.82.242:9000/wilow/hermesik.exe (URLhaus 4049483). Extracted .loldcfg section at raw offset 0xcc200 (magic LOLD_CFG_V1): C2 Base URL = http://144.31.53.142:8093 (User-Agent: Lold/1.0), delivery_mode = chunks, payload_id = p_cd2f8d7fd6dbd230, build_exe_name = bld_C6h67XDjY-FEeNPOAEDhElF9.exe, poll_interval = 1800s, Bearer/X-Chunk-Key prefix = k_a126... (50 bytes, SHA-256 b48e1353901b2390eb81e4f37dece72934297f83309f3d6bfd298c725ac87a33), persistence mask at +0xFA0 = 0x1F, identity salt at +0x112C = s_cfda580f07dc0e88961f49a4c9160565. In Tria.ge 261101-nsnsaaat3s, hermesik.exe fetched http://144.31.53.142:8093/chunks/p_cd2f8d7fd6dbd230/v3/manifest.json (X-Fileserver-Scheme: rsnk) and 0.bin..5.bin (6 x 3,243,136 bytes), reconstructed and executed the downstream Hermes payload OneDriveUpdate.exe (SHA-256 f26a0a27dfa8b7f20413a6c1818752cf25031cf9700ca7ffaa161e7b16eb16c2), which exfiltrated LZNT1-compressed stealer data to http://144.31.53.142:8787/api/client/report (User-Agent: local-state-simple-api/1.0) and streamed live desktop video via WebSocket to ws://144.31.53.142:8080/ws/publisher (User-Agent: DesktopStreamClient/0.1; panel at http://144.31.53.142:8700)."
      }
